{"id":"n86772-1-9","stage":4,"title":"호출 · 呼出","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n86772-1-9-1","ko":"급한 일로 지수 씨를 만나러 왔는데 호출을 좀 해주시겠어요?","zh":"我有急事要见智秀小姐，能麻烦您叫她一下吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"급한","meaning":"急忙，急切，急促","explanation":"급하다：急忙，急切，急促；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"급하다","audio":"/audio/5c52cd24e00b6dba18be.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86862","senseId":"2","lemma":"급하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일로","meaning":"事情","explanation":"일：事情；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"6","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지수","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀","readings":[{"term":"지수","audio":"/audio/0d32317250d77806a4f2.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"씨를","meaning":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","explanation":"씨：用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"씨","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58145","senseId":"1","lemma":"씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"만나러","meaning":"见面，相逢","explanation":"만나다：见面，相逢；러：用于移动动词前，表示移动的目的：“去/来做……”。","readings":[{"term":"만나다","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66591","senseId":"2","lemma":"만나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왔는데","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"호출을","meaning":"呼出，呼叫","explanation":"호출：呼出，呼叫；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"호출","audio":"/audio/7ed9c4cb0ba9c85b765a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86772","senseId":"1","lemma":"호출","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해주시겠어요?","meaning":"做，干；表现前面的动作给他人的行为造成影响。","explanation":"하다：做，干；주다：表现前面的动作给他人的行为造成影响。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"},{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"5c52cd24e00b6dba","term":"급하다","zh":"急忙，急切，急促","audio":"/audio/5c52cd24e00b6dba18be.mp3","entryId":"86862","definition":"做事匆促，没有闲暇。","pronunciation":["그파다"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"所处的情形或状况。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"c90eea3c6347f1e0","term":"씨","zh":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3","entryId":"58145","definition":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","pronunciation":["씨"]},{"id":"b1bced847edb7e2e","term":"만나다","zh":"见面，相逢","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3","entryId":"66591","definition":"其中一人来或去，二人因而相见。","pronunciation":["만나다"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了某个目的或事情而从别的地方移动到这里。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"7ed9c4cb0ba9c85b","term":"호출","zh":"呼出，呼叫","audio":"/audio/7ed9c4cb0ba9c85b765a.mp3","entryId":"86772","definition":"通过电话或电报等呼叫对方。","pronunciation":["호출"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"表现前面的动作给他人的行为造成影响。","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"表现前面的动作给他人的行为造成影响。","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/36d5e03b3cd9e7a6abd2.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n86772-1-9-2","ko":"알겠습니다. 곧 불러 드리겠습니다.","zh":"好的，我马上叫她过来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"알겠습니다.","meaning":"懂，明白","explanation":"알다：懂，明白；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"9","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"곧","meaning":"马上，就","explanation":"곧：马上，就","readings":[{"term":"곧","audio":"/audio/c2f53c24d77970856333.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26802","senseId":"1","lemma":"곧","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"불러","meaning":"请，叫","explanation":"부르다：请，叫；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"부르다","audio":"/audio/169eb5d7a0d76e97fa7f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57304","senseId":"9","lemma":"부르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"드리겠습니다.","meaning":"(尊称)表示前面的言语或行动给他人的行动带来影响。","explanation":"드리다：(尊称)表示前面的言语或行动给他人的行动带来影响。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"드리다","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59252","senseId":"1","lemma":"드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"懂，明白","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"对于对方的某个命令或请求，同意听从。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]},{"id":"c2f53c24d7797085","term":"곧","zh":"马上，就","audio":"/audio/c2f53c24d77970856333.mp3","entryId":"26802","definition":"不拖延，紧接着。","pronunciation":["곧"]},{"id":"169eb5d7a0d76e97","term":"부르다","zh":"请，叫","audio":"/audio/169eb5d7a0d76e97fa7f.mp3","entryId":"57304","definition":"请求对方过来。","pronunciation":["부르다"]},{"id":"e583f55bf1cfad46","term":"드리다","zh":"(尊称)表示前面的言语或行动给他人的行动带来影响。","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3","entryId":"59252","definition":"(尊称)表示前面的言语或行动给他人的行动带来影响。","pronunciation":["드리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5d371457ea173c63140c.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.105,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=86772","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":147,"sequenceScore":2.9317,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["好的，我马上叫她过来。","我有急事要见智秀小姐，能麻烦您叫她一下吗？","我真搞不懂敏俊心里在想什么啊。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我有急事要见智秀小姐，能麻烦您叫她一下吗？","我真搞不懂敏俊心里在想什么啊。","好的，我马上叫她过来。"],"answer":2}]}
